   No @inject IStringLocalizer line: the section carries no resource set at all. Its two
   pages are admin-only English (design §3b's first question), and
   AuditLogArchitectureTests.SectionTypesTakeNoStringLocalizer pins that, so the day
   someone adds copy the build tells them to carve a resource set first. *@
